<title>USA: Dial Corp Q1 shr drops.</title>
<headline>Dial Corp Q1 shr drops.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>THE DIAL CORPORATION</p>
<p>			     Summary of Results</p>
<p>				  (Unaudited)</p>
<p>			  In Millions (except per share information)</p>
<p>						     Quarter Ended</p>
<p>			     March 29, 1997	     March 30, 1996</p>
<p>Revenues			     $316.2			 $352.4</p>
<p>Costs and expenses:</p>
<p>  Cost of products sold	   169.3			  175.3</p>
