<p>NOTE: (a)  The Dial Corporation was spun off from its former parent and became a publicly traded company on August 15, 1996.  Accordingly, per share amounts for the quarter ended March 30, 1996, are presented on a pro forma basis using the number of common and equivalent shares issued in the spin-off, even though there were no shares outstanding.</p>
